Part of like all Hindu Dharma is a very interesting thing.

484
00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:33.600
In India, every temple gives sacred food out.

485
00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.400
Like you can walk through a Holy village

486
00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.130
