487
00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:40.060
That's part of Hindu Dharma is you're supposed

488
00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:41.833
to be growing the food with love,

489
00:19:42.706 --> 00:19:45.240
preparing the food with love,

490
00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:47.600
and then offering the food with love,

491
00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.410
and then you distribute the food with love.

492
00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.480
And that's called Prashad or food cooked

493
00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:56.020
