497
00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.540
Because everyone needs love, ultimately.

498
00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:08.490
It's not everybody needs food.

499
00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:11.070
We give this to the wealthy or the poor,

500
00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:11.980
