501
00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:16.680
So these Krishna devotees would set up giving food out.

502
00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:18.820
And I think the guys from the Cro-Mags

503
00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:21.070
used to get food from here and they used to read

504
00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:21.960
the Bhagavad Gita.

505
00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:25.253
And so Harley from the Cro-Mags who was, you know.

