in order to get in maintain sobriety.

1795
01:16:01.820 --> 01:16:03.730
And a lot of people can't,

1796
01:16:03.730 --> 01:16:06.320
they just can't grok it, you know, and they just,

1797
01:16:06.320 --> 01:16:09.300
they walk out the door because the minute the word God

1798
01:16:09.300 --> 01:16:13.810
is uttered, or the phrase that this is a spiritual program

1799
01:16:13.810 --> 01:16:17.760
the lights just go out because of their life experience

1800
01:16:17.760 --> 01:16:20.910
