1804
01:16:29.080 --> 01:16:31.130
It's sad.

1805
01:16:31.130 --> 01:16:34.680
And I get it, and I never had a traumatic experience

1806
01:16:34.680 --> 01:16:37.533
with spirituality, but I can understand that.

1807
01:16:39.076 --> 01:16:40.760
And all I can say is that just

1808
01:16:40.760 --> 01:16:42.960
because there's counterfeit doesn't mean there's

1809
01:16:42.960 --> 01:16:45.400
not something substantial as well.

1810
01:16:45.400 --> 01:16:48.140
When people use the argument philosophically.

1811
01:16:48.140 --> 01:16:49.810
Well, you know, I don't believe in a higher power.

1812
01:16:49.810 --> 01:16:50.850
I think that's just nonsense.

1813
01:16:50.850 --> 01:16:54.670
