1814
01:16:54.670 --> 01:16:56.140
He's a higher power.

1815
01:16:56.140 --> 01:16:57.130
Or how about the son?

1816
01:16:57.130 --> 01:16:58.200
The son is a higher power.

1817
01:16:58.200 --> 01:16:59.610
The wind is a higher power.

1818
01:16:59.610 --> 01:17:01.620
There's many, many higher powers.

1819
01:17:01.620 --> 01:17:04.740
I always say that the collective consciousness

1820
01:17:04.740 --> 01:17:06.830
of the group, like if you walk into a room

1821
01:17:06.830 --> 01:17:07.920
and there's 30 people

1822
01:17:07.920 --> 01:17:10.360
