1824
01:17:12.020 --> 01:17:15.650
Then that is a power greater than yourself.

1825
01:17:15.650 --> 01:17:16.882
There you go.

1826
01:17:16.882 --> 01:17:19.460
That's another way to be nicely put it too.

1827
01:17:19.460 --> 01:17:23.230
So yeah I don't think that is so farfetched, a higher power.

1828
01:17:23.230 --> 01:17:25.870
And I think people just have to break these things down

1829
01:17:25.870 --> 01:17:29.213
but yeah, if there's trauma behind it, it's tough.

1830
01:17:32.490 --> 01:17:33.990
All right so you're in India

1831
01:17:33.990 --> 01:17:35.650
