I did monk I think for about six and a half years.

1835
01:17:39.920 --> 01:17:41.430
Six and a half years.

1836
01:17:41.430 --> 01:17:43.930
Celibate monk in your 20s.

1837
01:17:43.930 --> 01:17:45.880
