Juna going to war against his will, right.

1851
01:18:20.700 --> 01:18:24.513
Like having to fulfill his blueprint or his destiny.

1852
01:18:26.810 --> 01:18:28.346
Yeah, exactly.

1853
01:18:28.346 --> 01:18:30.860
And I realized, wow, this is the Gita.

1854
01:18:30.860 --> 01:18:32.140
This is the Gita.

1855
01:18:32.140 --> 01:18:35.722
My job isn't to give up music or truthfully,

1856
