that were sort of musically inclined.

1867
01:19:07.140 --> 01:19:09.707
And we started a second band after I'd given up that band.

1868
01:19:09.707 --> 01:19:13.350
And that's how Shelter started, probably historically

1869
01:19:13.350 --> 01:19:15.100
was the first celibate rock band

1870
01:19:15.100 --> 01:19:16.780
in the history of the world.

1871
01:19:16.780 --> 01:19:20.360
Well, it's gotta be the only band comprised of monks

1872
01:19:20.360 --> 01:19:24.077
except for some kind of Keaton situations--

1873
01:19:24.077 --> 01:19:26.410
It was (indistinct) punk hardcore band.

1874
01:19:26.410 --> 01:19:29.120
But of all monks, it was actually very matter of fact,

1875
01:19:29.120 --> 01:19:30.470
we had no clothing.

1876
01:19:30.470 --> 01:19:32.070
