1894
01:20:14.250 --> 01:20:17.990
I think cause the punk scene was anything goes.

1895
01:20:17.990 --> 01:20:20.890
And so we're a bunch of Hindu monks

1896
01:20:22.300 --> 01:20:24.480
and it was almost like, why not?

1897
01:20:24.480 --> 01:20:25.890
Why not?

1898
01:20:25.890 --> 01:20:28.600
Like it's either you loved us or you hated us.

1899
01:20:28.600 --> 01:20:30.850
But it was sort of in the conversation.

