you're not allowed to, I'm not allowed to do,

1918
01:21:10.840 --> 01:21:13.510
what's the punk rule book I have to follow by, and be like,

1919
01:21:13.510 --> 01:21:17.690
isn't all music started as like a spiritual celebration.

1920
01:21:17.690 --> 01:21:19.930
Isn't that the origins of music anyway,

1921
01:21:19.930 --> 01:21:21.680
who are you to say I can't do this.

1922
01:21:22.690 --> 01:21:25.590
And as far as punk scene goes, I was like a big player

1923
01:21:25.590 --> 01:21:27.120
