where you got some guy, you couldn't care less,

1941
01:22:08.320 --> 01:22:11.040
you're eating that consciousness and it really affects you.

1942
01:22:11.040 --> 01:22:14.500
And that's not gonna show up under some, you know

1943
01:22:14.500 --> 01:22:16.320
when you're breaking down food and just made up

1944
01:22:16.320 --> 01:22:18.750
this vitamins is not gonna show up on the list

1945
01:22:18.750 --> 01:22:19.950
