1946
01:22:19.950 --> 01:22:20.867
Love is not gonna show.

1947
01:22:20.867 --> 01:22:22.640
I'm the nutrition facts panel.

1948
01:22:22.640 --> 01:22:25.070
How much love was infused into the preparation

1949
01:22:25.070 --> 01:22:27.160
of this food on a scale of one to a 100.

1950
01:22:27.160 --> 01:22:28.210
It makes a difference.

1951
01:22:28.210 --> 01:22:30.883
It's why people love, you know, home cooked meals.

1952
01:22:31.850 --> 01:22:32.964
So we did--

1953
01:22:32.964 --> 01:22:34.220
So you're making your own doll and like--

1954
01:22:34.220 --> 01:22:36.870
We brought our own candy stove on tour with us.

1955
01:22:36.870 --> 01:22:39.410
And we not only cook for ourselves, we cook for,

1956
