You're supposed to trash the house.

1978
01:23:28.926 --> 01:23:29.759
I know, we clean their houses.

1979
01:23:29.759 --> 01:23:30.592
Oh my God.

1980
01:23:30.592 --> 01:23:31.890
So you just were on tour.

1981
