1993
01:24:12.180 --> 01:24:13.013
No, I don't.

1994
01:24:13.013 --> 01:24:13.846
Do you do this?

1995
01:24:13.846 --> 01:24:14.679
No, I don't.

1996
01:24:14.679 --> 01:24:15.512
Do you do this?

1997
01:24:15.512 --> 01:24:16.345
No, I don't.

1998
01:24:16.345 --> 01:24:18.040
And it's sort of a safe parameter

1999
