and you go on Rogan, it's gonna be a lot about that.

2022
01:25:27.040 --> 01:25:27.890
So it was interesting

2023
01:25:27.890 --> 01:25:31.203
that you had that background and that's how you knew Joe.

2024
01:25:32.130 --> 01:25:36.350
But I just remember that that conversation stuck with me.

2025
01:25:36.350 --> 01:25:39.010
When that was done, three hours later, I was like

2026
01:25:39.010 --> 01:25:40.410
I was really impacted

2027
01:25:40.410 --> 01:25:42.180
by the conversation that you had with him.

2028
01:25:42.180 --> 01:25:44.340
And it's stayed with me and what was that,

2029
01:25:44.340 --> 01:25:45.173
like two years ago

