01:25:46.722 --> 01:25:50.320
One year ago today, maybe like practically a year ago.

2032
01:25:50.320 --> 01:25:51.153
Yeah. I loved it.

2033
01:25:51.153 --> 01:25:53.560
And I was like, I remember thinking like

2034
01:25:53.560 --> 01:25:55.455
