2321
01:38:59.300 --> 01:39:01.070
And you know, the show was over.

2322
01:39:01.070 --> 01:39:03.730
People were leaving and there's violence.

2323
01:39:03.730 --> 01:39:04.830
Sometimes it happens at a show.

2324
01:39:04.830 --> 01:39:06.300
