2330
01:39:18.780 --> 01:39:20.400
So I was like, okay

2331
01:39:20.400 --> 01:39:22.570
this is what happens when you stay up late at night,

2332
01:39:22.570 --> 01:39:23.780
crazy stuff starts selling--

2333
01:39:23.780 --> 01:39:27.070
Were there like dudes that worked at the venue there also,

2334
01:39:27.070 --> 01:39:27.903
or just--

2335
