2339
01:39:35.880 --> 01:39:38.516
It's not like there's a security team.

2340
01:39:38.516 --> 01:39:40.940
So I ran inside.

2341
01:39:40.940 --> 01:39:42.970
Our van is like, all the windows

2342
01:39:42.970 --> 01:39:46.410
and doors are open and our roadies are loading it in,

2343
01:39:46.410 --> 01:39:48.400
the roadies are also monks.

2344
01:39:48.400 --> 01:39:49.610
And so I was like, you guys

2345
01:39:49.610 --> 01:39:51.240
