2348
01:39:54.760 --> 01:39:57.130
And the Brody's are looking at me.

2349
01:39:57.130 --> 01:39:58.310
Like we can't go anywhere.

2350
01:39:58.310 --> 01:40:00.350
It's like, we're not even loaded in yet.

2351
01:40:00.350 --> 01:40:03.590
