in front of our van.

2356
01:40:15.040 --> 01:40:19.833
So we couldn't get out and sort of sealing up the exit.

2357
01:40:20.950 --> 01:40:22.200
And the only people left

2358
01:40:22.200 --> 01:40:24.770
