2359
01:40:24.770 --> 01:40:27.580
The PA guy, a few, you know, not many people left

2360
01:40:27.580 --> 01:40:30.830
in the venue and this guy gets out of the car.

2361
01:40:30.830 --> 01:40:32.040
The whole gang gets out of the car.

2362
01:40:32.040 --> 01:40:35.440
And this one guy who is massive, like just

2363
01:40:35.440 --> 01:40:40.037
like a massive Hulk of a man, horse of a man,

2364
01:40:40.037 --> 01:40:42.550
puts his hand in his back pocket and grabs a gun

2365
